Work in progress, one folder per item, moved as a unit: `proposed/<yyyy-mm-dd_slug>/` (captured, and scoped and planned there) and `active/<yyyy-mm-dd_slug>/` (implementation under way: only /implement-plan moves an item here, when it starts). The contract (item.md format, files, screenshot naming, which skill writes what) is docs/claude/work-item-workflow.md; the skills are /report-bug, /propose-work, /tech-debt, /scope-work, /tech-plan, /implement-plan, /pr-review, /pr-package.
Finished items leave this folder: signed-off ones go to ../.ai-plans-completed/<slug>/, then their documentation to ../.pr/<slug>/ at /pr-package. The four items migrated from flat plans on 2026-10-31 are `type: legacy-plan` (tech-plan.md is the old plan, steps instead of phases, never scoped).
The plan hook (.claude/hooks/plan-context.js) lists every folder in active/. Flat `*.md` plans are still read by the hook and the qplan skill in the sibling repos (Shattered-AI, DSL), not here. `screenshots/incremental/` inside any item is git-ignored on purpose; `screenshots/showcase/` is tracked.
